feat(multimonitor): implement mirrored monitor replicas and Win32 monitor catalog

Implement Stage E7 (Multimonitor and mirrored replica):
- Add Win32MonitorCatalog (EnumDisplayMonitors, GetMonitorInfoExW, GetDpiForMonitor) without WinForms, plus per-monitor taskbar/geometry resolution in TaskbarMonitor and Win32WindowGeometrySource.
- Add v4->v5 schema migration (AddMonitorReplicaMigration) for enabledReplicaMonitors and secondary monitor toggles in SettingsViewModel/SettingsWindow (mirror-only mode per Q-04).
- Subscribe DockBarViewModel (IDisposable) to IConfigurationDocument.Changed with anti-loop guards so ribbons and shortcuts stay mirrored in exact order across all active bars.
- Add MultiMonitorCoordinator and WpfBarHostFactory to spawn, dock per monitor, close on disconnect and restore on reconnect (E7-CA3..E7-CA5).
- Update docs/plan/ESTADO.md to close E7 (477/477 tests passing, 0.0064% CPU, 47.02 MB avg RAM).

Refs: RF05, HU05 (CA #2), §4.6-02, E7-CA1..E7-CA5, Q-04, R-04, R-05